{"words": [{"text": "هَـٰٓأَنتُمْ", "translation": "Lo! You are"}, {"text": "أُو۟لَآءِ", "translation": "those"}, {"text": "تُحِبُّونَهُمْ", "translation": "you love them"}, {"text": "وَلَا", "translation": "but not"}, {"text": "يُحِبُّونَكُمْ", "translation": "they love you"}, {"text": "وَتُؤْمِنُونَ", "translation": "and you believe"}, {"text": "بِٱلْكِتَـٰبِ", "translation": "in the Book "}, {"text": "كُلِّهِۦ", "translation": "all of it"}, {"text": "وَإِذَا", "translation": "And when"}, {"text": "لَقُوكُمْ", "translation": "they meet you"}, {"text": "قَالُوٓا۟", "translation": "they say"}, {"text": "ءَامَنَّا", "translation": "We believe"}, {"text": "وَإِذَا", "translation": "And when"}, {"text": "خَلَوْا۟", "translation": "they are alone"}, {"text": "عَضُّوا۟", "translation": "they bite"}, {"text": "عَلَيْكُمُ", "translation": "at you"}, {"text": "ٱلْأَنَامِلَ", "translation": "the finger tips"}, {"text": "مِنَ", "translation": "(out) of"}, {"text": "ٱلْغَيْظِ ۚ", "translation": "[the] rage"}, {"text": "قُلْ", "translation": "Say"}, {"text": "مُوتُوا۟", "translation": "Die"}, {"text": "بِغَيْظِكُمْ ۗ", "translation": "in your rage"}, {"text": "إِنَّ", "translation": "Indeed"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "عَلِيمٌۢ", "translation": "(is) All-Knowing"}, {"text": "بِذَاتِ", "translation": "of what"}, {"text": "ٱلصُّدُورِ", "translation": "(is in) the breasts"}], "sahih": "Here you are loving them but they are not loving you, while you believe in the Scripture - all of it.1 And when they meet you, they say, \"We believe.\" But when they are alone, they bite their fingertips at you in rage. Say, \"Die in your rage. Indeed, Allāh is Knowing of that within the breasts.\""}